    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 12-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 stack on Si substrate with air incidence. Initialize all layers at 400 nm thickness. Apply bounded perturbation optimization with thickness limits 352-448 nm per layer. Evaluate absorptance/emissivity at normal incidence across 3000-5000 nm (suppression band) and 8000-13000 nm (emission band). Use gradient-based optimizer with early stopping if best_target_score improvement <1e-3 for 2 consecutive rounds. Report thicknesses_nm, best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, and run_status. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 3000-5000 nm, 8000-13000 nm. soft objectives: high emissivity in 8000-13000 nm; low emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count not exceeding 24.",
